0..79 Comment "//! The moves subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by every"
80..158 Comment "//! source that reads them (`import \"./file-base.gandr\";`): a file after POSIX"
159..236 Comment "//! open(2) and close(2), whose descriptor its holder releases by closing it,"
237..316 Comment "//! once. The handle is a linear resident, the end of a forked owner, so moving"
317..337 Comment "//! it is delegation"
